WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.248 --> 00:00:02.628
- I think most people don't win

00:00:02.628 --> 00:00:03.968
but I think the biggest reason

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.258
most people don't win

00:00:05.258 --> 00:00:06.898
is they don't know themselves

00:00:06.898 --> 00:00:08.618
or they don't want to believe in

00:00:08.618 --> 00:00:10.218
what they know about themselves.

00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:12.818
And I think if you can 
figure out who you are

00:00:12.818 --> 00:00:14.068
you're just gonna be happier.

00:00:14.068 --> 00:00:15.808
It's not that making a 
million dollars a year,

00:00:15.808 --> 00:00:17.248
there's so many people 
listening right now

00:00:17.248 --> 00:00:20.099
that make $237,000 a year
and they're miserable

00:00:20.099 --> 00:00:21.414
and they'd be so much happier

00:00:21.414 --> 00:00:24.138
making a buck-43 or 89

00:00:24.138 --> 00:00:26.798
doing shit they love 
or they're good at.

00:00:26.798 --> 00:00:28.238
And we just don't do that.

00:00:28.238 --> 00:00:29.548
And for what Lance?

00:00:29.548 --> 00:00:33.678
For an extra bike or wine or

00:00:33.678 --> 00:00:35.639
better tickets to the 
Cowboys or Jets?

00:00:35.639 --> 00:00:36.710
It's silly.

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:38.739
(light music)

